  "features_added": [
    "Live-position enemies with patrol, pursuit, melee windup, recovery, lateral repositioning and return-home states",
    "Live-position targeting, click boxes, health/status labels and world-map markers",
    "Timed enemy hit validation against range and registered static cover",
    "Home-radius and safe-area disengagement with invulnerable return and full health on arrival",
    "Single-click player pursuit followed by one attack; no automatic player retaliation or action queues",
    "Northreach Camp, Briarwood, Ironroot Dig and Watchwarden Ruins",
    "Shared camp banking, supplies, cooking and smithing",
    "Briar wolves, stone crawlers and Watchwarden guardian with procedural animated shapes",
    "Coal, steel bars/sword, enemy loot and Beyond the Old Watch quest",
    "Additive frontier quest persistence and expanded map walking shortcuts"
  ],
